@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Liberation Serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
hide empty members
participant "GitHub" as P0
participant "Service" as P1
participant "Repository" as P2
participant "Docker" as P3
P0 -> P1: delivery A lần đầu
P1 -> P2: Reserve A
P2 -> P1: acquired
P1 -> P3: Provision A [async]
P0 -> P1: delivery A lặp
P1 -> P2: Reserve A
P2 -> P1: false, nil → no-op
P0 -> P1: delivery B khi quota đầy
P1 -> P2: Reserve B
P2 -> P1: ErrQuotaExceeded; chưa ghi key B
@enduml